        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Follow up of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3479777678\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41381\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41381/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41381\">#41381</a>. In this PR, I introduced the fundamental APIs for DOM in the \"Anatomy of the DOM\" guide, which is important for further guides. In preparation of more rewrites, I'm generalizing the other two oddly specific DOM guide pages, and it should be apparent what I plan to add to them.</p>",
